  "description": "Jimmy V.2: Smarter, sleeker, and ready for every adventure.\n\nBuilt for gravel, bikepacking, and endless journeys, Jimmy V.2 carries forward the proven geometry of its predecessor with thoughtful upgrades. Now compatible with SHIMANO Di2, it features our refined steel fin dropout and durable MKPT Chromoly tubing—seamless, heat-treated, and multi-butted for an exceptional balance of weight and strength.\n\nPaired with the versatile No.11 carbon fork, Jimmy V.2 offers multiple cargo and mounting options. It also retains stealth dropper post routing, top tube “fuel” bag mounts, and ED black coating inside and out for added durability.\n\nFrom gravel roads to long bikepacking trips, Jimmy V.2 is a dependable steel companion built for the long ride.",
